" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 68/71</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ESL101/flm1/d69/069.webp\" alt=\"ESL101 · Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 69\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 69/71</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ESL101/flm1/d69/070.webp\" alt=\"ESL101 · Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 70\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 70/71</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/ESL101/flm1/d69/071.webp\" alt=\"ESL101 · Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 71\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"906\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Reference Sociolinguistics (Oxford Introduction to Language Study Series) · slide 71/71</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
