    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ESL101 · Assessment 1/6</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14364 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ESL101 · Đầu điểm 1/6</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14364 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">~15mins/ group</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">N/A</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Lessons and topics learned from Chapters 1-7 of the Coursebook. Topics are to be chosen by the instructor.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">In class, supervised by the class instructor. Students will be divided into groups of 4~5 members. Each group will present a topic/ unit from the lesson using PowerPoint and other visual aids. Topics will be assigned by the instructor.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 36 — Assignment 1 Presentation</li><li>Session 37 — Assignment 1 Presentation</li><li>Session 38 — Assignment 1 Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Assignment 2 Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Assignment 2 Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Assignment 2 Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 36 — Assignment 1 Presentation</li><li>Buổi 37 — Assignment 1 Presentation</li><li>Buổi 38 — Assignment 1 Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Assignment 2 Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Assignment 2 Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Assignment 2 Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
